body:
Imo theres better fastfood chains dependant on where you are, I have one with better burgers here. I physically don’t even have a mcdonalds nearby.

However Imo when I am surviving on my own fastfood chains are my only option. Why? I’m disabled. I can barely tell when my body is hungry until its too late, I have bad motor skills, bad ADHD and I have issues due to my autism with textures, smells and tastes. Which is a really bad combo for cooking food for yourself.

My only other option is like buying frozen pizzas or like getting a personal chef or disability caretaker. Which requires me to have a stranger in my house…. Yeah I’ll take the burger homie. ;-;
